#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../mountbridge.templates:1001
msgid "Allow ${user} to mount NFS and SMB shares?"
msgstr ""

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../mountbridge.templates:1001
msgid ""
"MountBridge mounts NFS and SMB/CIFS shares through a small root helper that "
"only members of the \"mountbridge\" group may run."
msgstr ""

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../mountbridge.templates:1001
msgid ""
"If you accept, ${user} is added to that group; it takes effect at their next "
"login. Other users can be given access later with \"adduser <user> "
"mountbridge\", or from within MountBridge. SSHFS mounts need no special "
"access."
msgstr ""
